 "check": {
  "describe": "Central Station with a bus icon, then rows 12 Airport Terminal 3 min, 7 Harbour Front +4 9 min, N3 Old Town 17 min. 320x160 and 480x200: three one-line rows. 160x160: two rows, the destination on its own line. 240x240 and 360x480: three stacked rows filling the height. Tapping a row opens its status and details (the row grows, the slots shift to keep it on screen) and tapping it again closes it. With d1Min 0 row 1 reads Now; with all minutes -1 the empty state shows.",
